node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vercel
**/.vercel
**/.claude

# Secrets never enter the build context — the VM injects them via env_file.
#
# The `**/` prefix is load-bearing: .dockerignore patterns are anchored at the
# context root, so a bare `.env.*` misses apps/web/.env.local and
# apps/api/.env.local entirely. Without it `next build` reads the developer's
# local .env.local, which bakes local secrets into the image and inlines any
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* value into the client bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

docs
design
scripts/verify-contrast.mjs
*.log
